//! Runtime support for programs generated by `luarc`.
//!
//! Memory management is a cycle-tracking managed heap (see
//! `docs/runtime-foundation.md` and [`gc`]): every shared table, closure, mutable
//! upvalue cell and native object is a managed pointer; acyclic objects are freed
//! immediately and unreachable cycles by the collector. Source-level errors travel
//! as [`LuaError`] values through `Result`, never as panics.

